{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:207","content":{"id":207,"title":"23 抗体","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见抗体长得像有两只钳子的小龙虾，体积很小，抗体具有针对性，会吧相应的病原体都洗出来，然后用小钳子紧紧抓住，一旦和病原体结合，就不会松手。抗体尾端可以方便地结合到免疫细胞上。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体的作用："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调理病原体，抓住敌人，让免疫细胞觉得敌人更美味"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"攻击敌人，如果是病毒，抗体会直接中和病毒"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体有两个钳子，可以同时抓住两个敌人，几百万抗体可以把大量病原体黏在一起，铁索连环，然后巨噬细胞和中性粒细胞就可以更容易发现，然后干掉他们"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体可以直接支援免疫细胞，病原体不太好抓，浑身是油，抗原像强力胶黏上，然后尾端和免疫细胞结合，就好抓了"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"尾端还可以激活补体系统，将补体引向细菌"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先天性免疫系统负责作战，适应性系统让进攻更快、更准、更狠。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"disableDrag":false}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"23 抗体","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:207","type":"doc","id":207}}],"prevPage":{"title":"22 T 细胞和 B 细胞的共舞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:206","type":"doc","id":206}},"nextPage":{"title":"24 沼泽之国：黏膜","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:210","type":"doc","id":210}},"createTime":1741567269899,"updateTime":1756124030450,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124030450}}